%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral', 'themeVariables': {'fontFamily': 'Inter, system-ui', 'lineWidth': '2'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Processor as RecordProcessor
    participant Writer as DeltaWriter
    participant Lock as LockPort
    participant Arrow as PyArrow
    participant Delta as deltalake (Rust)
    participant Storage as Local FS
    participant Metrics as MetricsPort

    Note over Processor,Writer: Phase 1: Pre-Write Lock Validation

    Processor->>Writer: merge(records, table="silver/chembl/activity", primary_key=["content_hash"])
    activate Writer

    Writer->>Lock: validate_owner(key="lock:chembl_activity", owner_id)
    Lock-->>Writer: True (valid)

    Note over Writer,Arrow: Phase 2: Convert to Arrow

    Writer->>Arrow: to_arrow_table(records)
    activate Arrow
    Note right of Arrow: Schema inference<br/>Type mapping:<br/>• str → utf8<br/>• int → int64<br/>• float → float64<br/>• datetime → timestamp
    Arrow-->>Writer: pa.Table
    deactivate Arrow

    Note over Writer,Delta: Phase 3: Open Delta Table

    Writer->>Delta: open_table(path)
    activate Delta
    Delta->>Storage: read _delta_log/
    Storage-->>Delta: Transaction log entries
    Delta-->>Writer: DeltaTable(version=N)
    deactivate Delta

    Note over Writer,Delta: Phase 4: Execute Merge Operation

    alt mode == "merge" (SilverWriteMode.MERGE)
        Writer->>Delta: merge(source=table, target=path, predicate="content_hash")
        activate Delta
        Note right of Delta: MERGE INTO target<br/>USING source<br/>ON source.content_hash = target.content_hash<br/>WHEN MATCHED THEN UPDATE SET *<br/>WHEN NOT MATCHED THEN INSERT *

        Delta->>Delta: Compute diff
        Note right of Delta: Identify:<br/>• New records (INSERT)<br/>• Changed records (UPDATE)<br/>• Unchanged (skip)

        Delta->>Storage: Write new Parquet files
        Storage-->>Delta: file_paths
        Delta->>Storage: Write _delta_log/{version+1}.json
        Storage-->>Delta: OK

        Delta-->>Writer: MergeResult(inserted, updated, deleted)
        deactivate Delta

    else mode == "append" (SilverWriteMode.APPEND)
        Writer->>Delta: write_deltalake(table, mode="append")
        activate Delta
        Delta->>Storage: Write Parquet files
        Storage-->>Delta: file_paths
        Delta->>Storage: Write _delta_log/{version+1}.json
        Delta-->>Writer: WriteResult(rows_inserted)
        deactivate Delta

    else mode == "overwrite" (SilverWriteMode.DELETE)
        Writer->>Delta: write_deltalake(table, mode="overwrite")
        activate Delta
        Delta->>Storage: Write new Parquet files
        Delta->>Storage: Write _delta_log with tombstones
        Delta-->>Writer: WriteResult(rows_inserted)
        deactivate Delta
    end

    Note over Writer,Lock: Phase 5: Post-Write Lock Validation

    Writer->>Lock: validate_owner(key="lock:chembl_activity", owner_id)
    Lock-->>Writer: True (still valid)

    Note right of Writer: Safety Guard Pattern:<br/>If lock lost during write,<br/>another process may have<br/>written conflicting data.<br/>This check ensures consistency.

    Note over Writer,Metrics: Phase 6: Emit Metrics

    Writer->>Metrics: observe_histogram("silver_write_duration_ms", duration)
    Writer->>Metrics: increment_counter("silver_records_written", count)
    Writer->>Metrics: set_gauge("silver_table_version", version)

    Writer-->>Processor: WriteResult
    deactivate Writer

    Note over Processor: WriteResult contains:<br/>• success: bool<br/>• records_written: int<br/>• version: int<br/>• files_added: list[str]<br/>• merge_stats: MergeStats

    rect rgb(255, 250, 205)
        Note over Writer,Delta: ACID Properties
        Note right of Delta: Delta Lake guarantees:<br/>• Atomicity: All-or-nothing writes<br/>• Consistency: Schema enforcement<br/>• Isolation: Optimistic concurrency<br/>• Durability: Transaction log
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 245)
        Note over Writer: Error Handling
        Note right of Writer: On lock validation failure:<br/>1. Abort transaction<br/>2. Raise LockNotHeldError<br/>3. DO NOT commit partial writes
    end
